"quickFilter.helpText" = "* is any characters, ? is exactly one.\n#red — files with that tag (a beginning is enough: #re), # — any tag, !#re — without it.\n*.png — every png.   IMG_????.jpg — four characters in a row.\nSeveral at once: png jpg or *.png&*.pdf — a space, &, |, comma and semicolon all mean “and also”.\nSo a name typed with a space reads as two searches and shows more than one word would.\n!copy* — exclude.   !*.tmp — everything but the temporary ones.\nWithout a star a term is a piece of the name: png|pdf.\nNarrowing goes inside one mask: *2026*.png — only pngs carrying 2026.\nSelect and Clear selection act on what is shown. Invert swaps the marks over — what was marked lets go, the rest is marked — and the list shows what became marked.";
